  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO Learning and Partnerships Development Saudi Arabia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO is expected to contribute to programme implementation related to Learning and Career Development of UNESCO&apos;s staff and non-personnel. HRM/LPD is responsible for attracting and training a diverse, competent, and performance driven workforce. The JPO will play an essential role in providing learning &amp; and career development opportunities to ensure that the staff of the Organization have the skills they need to deliver on SDGs and meet their full potential. The JPO will also participate in setting up outreach events and establishing HR Partnerships with governmental, academic and private sector entities.</narrative>
  </description>
